/** @mainpage Qore amqp Module

    @tableofcontents

    @section amqpintro amqp Module Introduction

    <img src="amqp-logo.svg" width="96" alt="amqp module logo"/>

    The \c amqp module provides an AMQP 1.0 messaging interface for %Qore using the
    <a href="https://qpid.apache.org/proton/">Apache Qpid Proton</a> C++ library.

    This module provides:
    - The @ref Qore::Amqp::AmqpConnection "AmqpConnection" class for connecting to AMQP 1.0 brokers
    - The @ref Qore::Amqp::AmqpMessage "AmqpMessage" class for creating and reading AMQP messages
    - Full bidirectional type mapping between AMQP and %Qore types
    - TLS/SSL and SASL authentication support
    - Durable subscriptions and message selectors
    - Transaction support (commit/rollback)
    - Broker introspection via the AMQP Management Protocol
    - The @ref amqputilintro "AmqpUtil" module with high-level client, producer, consumer, and request-reply helpers
    - The @ref amqpdataproviderintro "AmqpDataProvider" module for data provider framework integration

    @section amqpqlibmodules Qore User Modules

    - @ref amqpdataproviderintro "AmqpDataProvider" — a data provider API for AMQP 1.0 messaging
    - @ref amqputilintro "AmqpUtil" — Qore AMQP 1.0 utility module

    @section amqpdocumentation Documentation

    - @anchor amqpexamples @subpage amqpexamplesguide — sending, receiving, subscriptions, and transactions
    - @anchor amqparch @subpage amqparchguide — connection, session, and message flow
    - @anchor amqp_connection_options @subpage amqp_connection_optionsguide — connection settings and defaults
    - @anchor amqptypemap @subpage amqptypemapguide — converting AMQP values to and from Qore types
    - @anchor amqphashdecls @subpage amqphashdeclsguide — typed connection and message metadata
    - @anchor amqp_exceptions @subpage amqp_exceptionsguide — errors reported by the module
    - @anchor amqprelnotes @subpage amqprelnotesguide — version history

*/
